# CareConnect Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# DEVELOPMENT (local):
#   VITE_API_URL is NOT required. The Vite dev server proxies /api requests to
#   the local backend automatically (see vite.config.ts → server.proxy).
#
#   If your backend runs on a port other than 5001, override at the terminal:
#     VITE_BACKEND_PORT=5000 npm run dev
#
# PRODUCTION:
#   VITE_API_URL must point to the deployed backend API URL.
#   Set this in your hosting dashboard (Render, Vercel, Netlify, etc.) and
#   trigger a new production build — the value is baked into the JS bundle.
#
# Example (production):
# VITE_API_URL=https://careconnect-api.onrender.com/api
